               MVC OPROBF+L'OPROBF-3-1(3),28-3(R13)                     00552000
               MVI OPROBF+L'OPROBF-1,C'%'                               00553000
               SPACE 1                                                  00554000
               MVC OTOTF,=CL(L'OTOTF)'Busy'                             00555000
